<%# Every claim here points at a control that exists. The delete button is on
    account settings rather than the profile page, which is where the design
    board said it was, and saying the wrong page is how someone concludes the
    feature is missing. %>

<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-2 dark:text-ink-2-on-dark">
  You can see everything we hold, change any of it, and delete all of it.
</p>

<ul class="flex flex-col gap-3">
  <li class="flex gap-3 items-start">
    <span class="text-good dark:text-good-on-dark shrink-0 mt-0.5">
      <%= render Utilities::IconComponent.new("check_circle", size: 5) %>
    </span>
    <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-3 dark:text-ink-3-on-dark">
      <span class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-ink-on-dark">See it.</span>
      Your profile page shows every answer you have given, grouped the way the sign-up questions were,
      and each section says whether it affects matching.
    </p>
  </li>
  <li class="flex gap-3 items-start">
    <span class="text-good dark:text-good-on-dark shrink-0 mt-0.5">
      <%= render Utilities::IconComponent.new("check_circle", size: 5) %>
    </span>
    <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-3 dark:text-ink-3-on-dark">
      <span class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-ink-on-dark">Change it.</span>
      Any section can be edited on its own, at any time. Nothing is locked after sign-up.
    </p>
  </li>
  <li class="flex gap-3 items-start">
    <span class="text-good dark:text-good-on-dark shrink-0 mt-0.5">
      <%= render Utilities::IconComponent.new("check_circle", size: 5) %>
    </span>
    <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-3 dark:text-ink-3-on-dark">
      <span class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-ink-on-dark">Delete it.</span>
      Account settings has a delete button. It removes your account, your health profile, your saved
      studies, your tags and your notes. It cannot be undone.
    </p>
  </li>
  <li class="flex gap-3 items-start">
    <span class="text-ink-4 dark:text-ink-4-on-dark shrink-0 mt-0.5">
      <%= render Utilities::IconComponent.new("info_circle", size: 5) %>
    </span>
    <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-3 dark:text-ink-3-on-dark">
      <span class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-ink-on-dark">One thing deletion cannot reach.</span>
      A study team you already contacted keeps whatever you sent them. That copy is theirs, not ours,
      and you would need to ask that team directly.
    </p>
  </li>
</ul>
